msgid "Remove application \"%1$s\" from the map?"
msgstr "Ukloniti aplikaciju \"%1$s\" sa mape?"

msgid "Remove service \"%1$s\" from the map?"
msgstr "Ukloniti servis \"%1$s\" sa mape?"

msgid "Its services, databases and external calls leave the map. Services shared with other applications stay."
msgstr "Njeni servisi, baze podataka i spoljni pozivi nestaju sa mape. Servisi deljeni sa drugim aplikacijama ostaju."

msgid "The service, its connections, databases and external calls leave the map."
msgstr "Servis, njegove veze, baze podataka i spoljni pozivi nestaju sa mape."

msgid "If the application is discovered again in new traces, it is recreated automatically, with all its entities."
msgstr "Ako se aplikacija ponovo otkrije u novim tragovima, automatski se ponovo kreira sa svim svojim entitetima."

msgid "If the service is discovered again in new traces, it is recreated automatically, with all its entities."
msgstr "Ako se servis ponovo otkrije u novim tragovima, automatski se ponovo kreira sa svim svojim entitetima."

msgid "Hosts, items and triggers in Zabbix are not changed."
msgstr "Hostovi, stavke i okidači u Zabbixu se ne menjaju."

msgid "Remove %1$s"
msgstr "Ukloni %1$s"

msgid "No data found"
msgstr "Nema pronađenih podataka"

msgid "No APM span matches the attribute filter in the selected time range. Change the filter above or press Reset to see everything."
msgstr "Nijedan APM span ne odgovara filteru atributa u izabranom vremenskom opsegu. Promenite filter iznad ili pritisnite Resetuj da vidite sve."

msgid "No APM traces in the selected time range and no host with the apm.requests item. Services appear here as soon as the applications send traces to the Zabbix proxy."
msgstr "Nema APM tragova u izabranom vremenskom opsegu i nema hosta sa stavkom apm.requests. Servisi se ovde pojavljuju čim aplikacije pošalju tragove Zabbix proxyju."

